{'problem_index': 121, 'code': 'theorem imo_1973_p3 (a b : ℝ) (h₀ : ∃ x, x ^ 4 + a * x ^ 3 + b * x ^ 2 + a * x + 1 = 0) :\n  4 / 5 ≤ a ^ 2 + b ^ 2 := by\n  obtain ⟨x, hx⟩ := h₀\n  have h1 := sq_nonneg (x ^ 2 + a / 2 * x)\n  have h2 := sq_nonneg (b * x + a / 2)\n  nlinarith [sq_nonneg (x ^ 2 - a / 2 * x), sq_nonneg (x - a / 2), sq_nonneg (b * x - a / 2),\n    sq_nonneg (x + a / 2), sq_nonneg (b * x + a / 2), sq_nonneg (x ^ 2 + a * x + 1)]', 'error': 'failed after too many retries'}
